sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
 participant Provider
 participant Parse as processAnthropicStream
 participant Turn
 participant AgentLoop as AgenticLoop
 participant Owner as TurnToolExecutionOwner
 participant Scheduler as CoreToolScheduler
 participant Dispatcher as ToolDispatcher
 participant Confirm as ConfirmationCoordinator
 participant Bus as MessageBus and policy owners
 participant UI as Approval handler
 participant Executor as ToolExecutor
 participant Tool as ToolInvocation
 participant Aggregate as ResultAggregator
 participant History as ConversationManager and HistoryService
 Provider->>Parse: streamed tool name and input fragments
 Parse->>Parse: bound bytes, completeToolCall, coerce args
 Parse-->>Turn: IContent tool_call
 Turn->>Turn: emitFunctionCallRequests, normalize name and ID
 Turn-->>AgentLoop: ToolCallRequest event
 AgentLoop->>Owner: begin, acquire callbacks, scheduleAndAwait
 Owner->>Owner: record admitted call IDs
 Owner->>Scheduler: session lease schedule with combined signal
 Scheduler->>Dispatcher: resolveAndValidate
 Dispatcher->>Tool: schema validation and build
 Dispatcher-->>Scheduler: validating call or structured error
 Scheduler->>Confirm: tryFastApprove then evaluateAndRoute
 Confirm->>Bus: evaluatePolicyDecision
 Bus->>Bus: session rules + workspace trust + PolicyEngine.evaluate
 alt ALLOW
 Bus-->>Confirm: ALLOW
 Confirm->>Scheduler: scheduled
 else DENY
 Bus-->>Confirm: DENY
 Confirm->>Scheduler: POLICY_VIOLATION and rejection
 else ASK
 Bus-->>Confirm: ASK
 Confirm->>Tool: shouldConfirmExecute(signal)
 alt no detail or existing bypass applies
 Confirm->>Scheduler: scheduled under current behavior
 else actual confirmation needed
 Confirm->>Bus: confirmation request with correlation and call IDs
 Bus->>Owner: owned request subscription
 Owner->>UI: show actual tool and arguments
 UI-->>Owner: approval, edit, or cancellation
 Owner->>Bus: respondToConfirmation
 Bus-->>Confirm: correlated decision
 Confirm->>Scheduler: update args/status, start or cancel
 end
 end
 opt call scheduled
 Scheduler->>Scheduler: attemptExecution, same-path ordering
 Scheduler->>Executor: launchToolExecution
 Executor->>Executor: BeforeTool, optional input rebuild
 Note over Confirm,Executor: Current input hook runs after policy, proposal moves preparation before policy
 Executor->>Tool: execute(signal, liveOutput, terminal, PID)
 Tool-->>Executor: ToolResult
 Executor->>Executor: AfterTool and output modifications
 Executor-->>Scheduler: post-hook ToolResult
 Scheduler->>Aggregate: bufferResult, publishBufferedResults
 Aggregate->>Aggregate: ordered publishResult, model conversion and token limits
 Aggregate-->>Scheduler: setSuccess or setError
 end
 Scheduler->>Scheduler: checkAndNotifyCompletion, telemetry
 Scheduler-->>AgentLoop: completion callback
 AgentLoop->>AgentLoop: buildNextMessage, cancellation and todo_pause handling
 AgentLoop->>History: bound recordCompletedToolHistory / recordHistory
 History->>History: HistoryService.addBatch, recording publication
 AgentLoop->>Provider: paired tool response blocks on continuation
 Note over AgentLoop,History: ChatSession also has eager completion recording with response-ID deduplication

